     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Reckoning. 1914-1921. (a German looks angrily over his shoulder at the destruction of Europe and a fallen crown and sword as he holds the Bill of Reparations in the InterWar era)</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
